From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Schultz <alexschultz002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:30:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(ren.c): doxygen comments

Hand port of d835f771 onto the patched tree, with audit verdicts:
- rstates[]: slot 1 is now used for all drawing incl. the cursor row, and the paint thread only uses 1 and 2 (threaded_redraw; merges the patch's own rewording).
- rstate is __thread: per-thread active cache.
- ren_position(): the opt_render_limit truncation is skipped with :lw (linewrap_v2).
- syn_highlight(): att entries are words (s64), not ints.
Patch-added ren_wrapw()/syn_getft() keep their existing (or no) comments.
Comments only; stripped binary identical.
